{"game":{"display_name":"決勝第二試合","duration_seconds":86094,"game_id":14,"game_type":"multiplayer","is_public":true,"main_players":[],"problem":{"description":"標準入力から複数行の英大文字からなるテキストが入力されます。\r\nテキストを時計回りに 90 度回転させて出力してください。\r\n\r\n行の長さが異なる場合、最も長い行に合わせて空白を埋めてください。\r\n\r\n入力例:\r\nABC\r\nDE\r\n\r\nFGHI\r\n\r\n出力例:\r\nF DA\r\nG EB\r\nH  C\r\nI   \r\n\r\n最後の行は「I」「空白」「空白」「空白」「改行」です。\r\n","language":"php","problem_id":14,"sample_code":"<?php\r\n$lines = [];\r\n$max_len = 0;\r\nwhile (($line = fgets(STDIN)) !== false) {\r\n    $s = rtrim($line, \"\\n\");\r\n    $lines[] = $s;\r\n    $max_len = max($max_len, strlen($s));\r\n}\r\n\r\n$row_count = count($lines);\r\nfor ($j = 0; $j < $max_len; $j++) {\r\n    $row = '';\r\n    for ($i = $row_count - 1; $i >= 0; $i--) {\r\n        $row .= $j < strlen($lines[$i]) ? $lines[$i][$j] : ' ';\r\n    }\r\n    echo $row . \"\\n\";\r\n}\r\n","title":"縦書き","sample_code_html":"<pre class=\"shiki github-light\" style=\"background-color:#fff;color:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">&#x3C;?</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">php</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">$lines </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">$max_len </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> (($line </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\"> fgets</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">STDIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">    $s </span><span style=\"color:#