\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">; $i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">--</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        $row </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">.=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> $j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\"> strlen</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">($lines[$i]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> $lines[$i][$j] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\"> ' '</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">    echo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> $row </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">.</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">}</span></span></code></pre>"},"started_at":1774083905}}
